<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Hey, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>! Wake up!"<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, hang in there...!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">From outside, the light of the midday sun.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">A dream...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Was it a dream...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is alive, so... a dream...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">No, it's not...!</STYLE><PG>
"You're soaked in sweat... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE>, go heat up the bath!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Got it!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, you okay? You were moaning in your sleep like crazy."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Uuu... </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">... please don't hate me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組みアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Senpai<STYLE ID="3">―I clung to her tight.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">And </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3"> gently hugged me back.</STYLE><PG>
"There, there. You had a scary dream. It's okay, it was all a dream."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It wasn't a dream... It wasn't a dream..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It was all just a dream...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But look, this!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">What was clutched in my hand―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\サード\花びら血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">it was a cherry petal with blood on it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The one I'd picked up in the dark hallway a little while ago.</STYLE><PG>
"This is... 
{PAUSE ""}
Yesterday, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, with <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> riding on you, you went <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="は">crawling</STYLE> all over the basement room, right? 
{PAUSE ""}
　You got scraped up then, and while we were carrying <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> here, a cherry petal―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Senpai<STYLE ID="3"> hadn't finished talking when I </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="のぞ">peered</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> into the mirror.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Unblinking, I </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="たいじ">faced off</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> with my own face.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Gazing... hard into my eyes―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\tumbling1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">I sank to the floor where I stood.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"See? They're all better."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Yes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The eyes reflected in the mirror were both black.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">They really... had healed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">All the strength went out of me.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Honestly, what am I gonna do with you..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家布団.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Senpai<STYLE ID="3"> changed the sheets that were </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ぬ">soaked</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> with my night sweat, and laid me down on them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The bath's gonna take a while to heat up, so let's wipe off your sweat. You'll catch a cold, sweating like this."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Drained of strength, I couldn't move, and I was at </STYLE>Senpai's<STYLE ID="3"> mercy as she undressed me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">As if I were being nursed, I simply left myself in </STYLE>Senpai's<STYLE ID="3"> hands.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"...</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hm?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and the others, what would you do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It'd mean you were hurting so bad you had to kill, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="3"> answered without missing a beat, still wiping my body.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What if it was me who killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
Then you'd have had a good enough reason, right? 
{PAUSE ""}
　I'm not gonna abandon <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> without hearing the reason."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"...Ehe..."</STYLE><PG>
"What is it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, because you're so kind..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You idiot. Turn around."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Turning me facedown, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3"> wiped the sweat from my back.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">So it really... was all a dream.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"The bath's 30 more minutes... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Oh! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Oh-ho!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Well, well... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> in her birthday suit, and her </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="かいがい">devoted</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> caretaker, </STYLE>Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So this is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">a-</STYLE>
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="2">dult-</STYLE>
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="2">hood."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"...Hey, you idiot over there, grab me another towel."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes, ma'aaam!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was really alive, too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"...Ehehe..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Why're you laughing again...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Because </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is kind too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Good for you. Everyone's kind."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家布団.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Hey, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>... what kind of dream did you have?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I killed everyone... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> found me and blamed me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">and a stranger gouged out my eyes. That was the dream."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see... Yeah, that'd be scary..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes... very..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"...Here, face up."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I wish </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> dying had been a dream too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah... it would have."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">―Once she'd wiped off my sweat, I wrapped myself up in the futon just as I was.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I pulled the futon tight around me and, as if seeking the feeling of my mother's womb, bound my body tightly in it.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, I'm here... So don't be scared anymore, okay?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, you're going through a hard time right now too, with your </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, aren't you? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　And for someone like me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Don't worry about it. Doing this takes my mind off things too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">My head was sticking out of the futon, and </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3"> gently stroked it.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Come to think of it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> said he'd tell us everything... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Should I hurry and go downstairs?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Papa</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was snoring away in the living room just now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Looks like he was up all night, so maybe later's better?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah. You should rest a little longer too, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Everyone, for my sake, staying up all night, staying by my side like this...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">... we only met because </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was there, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Even with </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> gone, we won't drift apart, will we?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You idiot... obviously, right? 
{PAUSE ""}
　Are <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> gonna leave me just 'cause <STYLE ID="8">Natsumi</STYLE> isn't around?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That... I'd absolutely hate that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Right?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Ehe, you two are such good buddies!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Got any idea how much allowance I've spent on <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> up to now? 
{PAUSE ""}
　Until she pays it back a million times over, I'm sticking to <STYLE ID="1">her</STYLE> forever!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
